      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要点什么？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898170B94EC04E48FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明明就没钱，\n你是来干嘛的啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E5C316CA194B1FF0C000A4F60662F67655E72561B7684554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ǐ<U+0000>是吧。\n稍等一下啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201CF0000662F54273002000A7A0D7B494E004E0B554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的火花烘焙咖啡！\n感受一下这款豆子略带焦香的风味吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B97684706B82B170D8711954965561FF01000A611F53D74E004E0B8FD96B3E8C465B5075655E2671269999768498CE5473542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的喷射火焰烘焙咖啡！\n品一品它的酸味、苦味和甜味吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B9768455B75C04706B713070D8711954965561FF01000A54C14E0054C15B83768491785473300182E65473548C751C5473542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的大字爆炎烘焙咖啡！\n它的香气和苦味比酸味要更重一些。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B9768459275B577206708E70D8711954965561FF01000A5B83768499996C14548C82E654736BD491785473898166F491CD4E004E9B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的燃尽烘焙咖啡！\n它的烘焙度最深，能尝到很重的苦味。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B9768471C35C3D70D8711954965561FF01000A5B83768470D871195EA667006DF1FF0C80FD5C1D52305F8891CD768482E6547330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的阿萨姆克儿红茶！它的香气甘甜，\n风味浓厚……还带有天空的味道！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B97684963F842859C6514B513F7EA28336FF015B83768499996C147518751CFF0C000A98CE54736D53539A202620268FD85E26670959297A7A768454739053FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的猫老大吉岭红茶！\n它的口感丝滑，带有独特的高雅香气。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B97684732B8001592754095CAD7EA28336FF01000A5B83768453E3611F4E1D6ED1FF0C5E26670972EC727976849AD896C599996C1430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的罗丝雷朵茶！它的香气浓郁，\n茶性温和，是在阿罗拉也很受欢迎的茶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B976847F574E1D96F767358336FF015B83768499996C146D5390C1FF0C000A833660276E29548CFF0C662F5728963F7F5762C94E5F5F8853D76B228FCE7684833630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的哞哞鲜奶！\n它可是营养丰富的鲜奶哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B9768454DE54DE9C9C5976FF01000A5B8353EF662F8425517B4E305BCC76849C9C597654E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的美味之水！\n它的含镁量好像比其他地区更高一些。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B976847F8E54734E4B6C34FF01000A5B837684542B954191CF597D50CF6BD451764ED65730533A66F49AD84E004E9B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来，你点的激爽之水！\n感受与硬水绝配的美味吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765FF0C4F6070B976846FC0723D4E4B6C34FF01000A611F53D74E0E786C6C347EDD914D76847F8E5473542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要从咖啡馆出去吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814ECE54965561998651FA53BB5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
